You're not going to annoy me.

491
00:23:55,809 --> 00:23:58,311
You're not gonna annoy me either.
So...

492
00:24:04,359 --> 00:24:05,694
I like you.

493
00:24:08,697 --> 00:24:10,281
[softly] I like you too.

494
00:24:13,577 --> 00:24:14,703
Okay.

495
00:24:16,121 --> 00:24:17,706
-Bye.
-Bye.

496
00:24:30,719 --> 00:24:32,095
[cell phone chimes]

497
00:24:32,179 --> 00:24:34,181
[upbeat music playing]

498
00:24:55,786 --> 00:24:56,995
[chuckles softly]

499
00:25:03,669 --> 00:25:05,003
[chuckles]

500
00:25:08,173 --> 00:25:10,383
-[mellow music playing]
-♪ If they had to tell someone ♪

501
00:25:10,467 --> 00:25:12,344
♪ That something had happened ♪

502
00:25:12,719 --> 00:25:17,390
♪ If they found me just lying there
What could they do? ♪

503
00:25:17,933 --> 00:25:22,604
♪ In case of an accident
Who could they notify? ♪

504
00:25:22,687 --> 00:25:27,442
♪ Would it be all right
If they notified you? ♪

505
00:25:36,201 --> 00:25:40,830
♪ When they give you the bad news
I'm sure you won't snicker ♪

506
00:25:40,914 --> 00:25:45,627
♪ You'll remember the good times
And all we went through ♪

507
00:25:46,336 --> 00:25:50,882
♪ And then I suppose
That you'll tell all the others ♪

508
00:25:51,007 --> 00:25:55,971
♪ Performing that awful task
Someone has to ♪

509
00:26:05,563 --> 00:26:10,151
♪ When they go through my wallet
And fish out my license ♪

510
00:26:10,235 --> 00:26:15,240
♪ They'll learn my DOB
And my eyes were blue ♪

511
00:26:16,366 --> 00:26:20,120
♪ As for my corneas
I don't care who gets 'em ♪

512
00:26:20,704 --> 00:26:26,126
♪ But all other organs
And parts are for you ♪

